Z||000002||Archie||10-02-2001||09:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fiero_24:<BR><B>My performance V6 will be out of the shop Oct 15th.  I need any suggestions or tips, from dropping the cradle to the install.  I have never dropped a cradle from a Fiero, and any advice would be helpful.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>On my web site, I have a section that has 18 pages and 80 captioned photos showing the steps involved in doing a V-8 swap. The First several pages deal with removing the original engine from the Fiero. I'll bet that it can be of quite a bit of help for you.<P>Check it out starting at  <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/v8install.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/v8install.htm</A> <P>Archie||||reg||1
